Base model
----------
This model is derived from NVIDIA's Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3
(nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3), (c) NVIDIA Corporation, licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC-BY-4.0).

    https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes: the weights were re-trained for speech in 25 languages and
compressed by Fermion Research. The FastConformer encoder architecture, the
TDT decoder, the tokenizer and the feature-extractor configuration derive from
that model and remain under CC-BY-4.0.

These weights are therefore distributed under CC-BY-4.0. The Fermion code in
the model repository remains under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Spireflow's changes
-------------------
Spireflow redistributes the published Phonon-2.5 weights unmodified. The
application bundles them alongside the frozen sidecar so that it can run
offline on first launch; it does not alter, fine-tune or re-quantize them.

